      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same, I found playing with Cloudflare Warp enabled makes game very unstable:\n\nWhen started It loads into the default home world instead of my own.\n\nMight randomly throw me into the login screen\n\nMight throw me into an error world when trying to join some other world\n\nSocials are half broken (shows no friends in favourite groups, but \"Friends Locations\" still works)\n\nVRC+ status is not loaded\n\nEmojis are not loaded (can't even throw a default emoji, the radial menu is just empty)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
