  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When attempting to connect to VrChat while having Cloudflare's WARP connection enabled, the game takes forever to load if it even does. When it is disabled the game loads fine but when enabled it makes playing the game a pain. It's just annoying to have to disable WARP for just VRC when it used to work fine last time I played",
